sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant R as Renderer(Settings)
    participant P as Preload(api.invoke)
    participant B as BackupService(main)
    participant FS as userData 文件

    Note over R,FS: ===== 导出 =====
    R->>R: flushChatStore()
    R->>R: localStorage.getItem('xuanshu-chat-store')
    R->>P: backup:export({chatStore})
    P->>B: exportData(chatStoreJson)
    B->>FS: PRAGMA wal_checkpoint(TRUNCATE)
    B->>FS: 收集 config.json / data/memories.db / vector-store.json / knowledge-graph/*.json
    B->>B: 写入 localStorage.json + manifest.json
    B->>B: dialog.showSaveDialog
    B->>B: adm-zip 打包写盘
    B-->>R: {success, path, sizeBytes}

    Note over R,FS: ===== 导入 =====
    R->>P: backup:import()
    P->>B: importData()
    B->>B: dialog.showOpenDialog
    B->>B: 解压临时目录 + validateManifest
    B->>B: 先备份现状 → backup-pre-import-*.zip
    B->>FS: 关闭db→覆盖 memories.db/vector-store.json/knowledge-graph/*/config.json
    B->>R: webContents.send('backup:restore-localstorage', json)
    R->>R: localStorage.setItem + rehydrate
    B-->>R: {success, restoredFiles[]}

    Note over R,FS: ===== ReAct 危险工具确认 =====
    participant A as ReActAgent
    participant T as ToolRegistry
    participant D as Dialog(confirm)
    A->>T: getFunctionCallingTools()
    A->>A: LLM 输出 → parseToolCall
    A->>T: tool = get(name)
    alt tool.dangerous
        A->>D: tool.confirm(params)
        D-->>A: 同意/拒绝
    end
    A->>T: execute(name, params)
    T-->>A: ToolResult → 追加上下文
